11. Find out how many coins should be stacked to match the height of the Statue of Unity. Assume each coin is \(\mathbf{1}\) mm thick.
Ans:
Height of each coin \(=1 \mathrm{~mm}\)
Height of Statue of Unity = \(180 \mathrm{~m}=180 \times 100 \times 10 \mathrm{~mm}=1,80,000 \mathrm{~mm}\).
