Find \((+7)-(+18)\).
To subtract 18 from 7, i.e., (+7) - (+18), we need to remove 18 positives from 7 positives.
![](https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/cfd9cba9-077b-4f37-a732-40ee0519eab8-377.jpg?height=88&width=542&top_left_y=732&top_left_x=758)

