\[\begin{gathered}
14 \times 6=\underbrace{2 \times 7}_{14} \times 2 \times 3 \\
14 \times 9=\underbrace{2 \times 7}_{14} \times 3 \times 3 \\
H C F=14 \times 3=42
\end{gathered}\]

